Author: Walter Esfrain Pereira [aut, cre, cph] (ORCID: <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1085-0191>), Magali Haidee Pereira Martinez [aut] (ORCID: <https://orcid.org/0009-0009-5419-959X>)
Maintainer: Walter Esfrain Pereira <maintainer@multiregflow.invalid>
Description: Provides a guided and auditable workflow for multiple linear
    regression focused on scientific interpretation, diagnostics,
    multicollinearity, variable selection, resampling, regularization,
    relative importance, robust covariance inference, flexible alternatives,
    and out-of-sample predictive validation. The package is designed for
    agricultural, soil, and plant-science applications and delegates
    specialized estimation to established R packages when appropriate.
